    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "How much is it?",
      "texto": "**¿Cuánto cuesta?** is for one thing. **¿Cuánto cuestan?** is for more than one.\n\n**Quiero** esta camisa. The **e** in querer becomes **ie**: quiero, quieres, quiere.\n\nPrices: cuesta veinte **euros**. The adjective matches the noun: la camisa es **cara**, el libro es **caro**. The opposite is **barato** or **barata**."
    },
